{"unit_id":"tag:046N:proof","translation":"蕴含 (1) <MATH_0001> (2) 是直接的。要证明 (2) 蕴含 (1)，须证明 (2) 中每个 <MATH_0002> 都位于函子（functor）<MATH_0003> 的本质像（image）中。为此，选取 (2) 中的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004> 以及同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0005>。于是得到 <MATH_0006> 的一个相对于 <MATH_0007> 的下降（descent）资料，取\n<MATH_0008>\n为满足 <MATH_0009> 的箭头（arrow）。由栈（stack）的公理，这个下降（descent）资料有效（effective），因而得到对象（object）<MATH_0010>，它属于 <MATH_0011>，位于 <MATH_0012> 上。我们省略 <MATH_0013> 同构（isomorphic）于 <MATH_0014>、该同构位于 <MATH_0015> 上的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"栈"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"Provisional functor term."},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"Essential image; provisional."},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"Provisional descent covering."},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"Provisional local-isomorphism term."},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"Descent datum; provisional."},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"Arrow specifying descent; provisional."},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"栈","context":"Provisional stack term."},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"Effectivity of descent; provisional."},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"Object obtained by descent; provisional."},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"Provisional isomorphism term."}],"notes":[]}
